---
title: "Unsaved work - consent before replacement or closing"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Action requested with saved work
  s1: Action requested with unsaved work
  s2: Project action allowed
  s3: Await save, discard or cancel decision
  s4: Project action cancelled
  s5: Try saving the current project
  s6: Save picker cancelled
  s7: Save failed
  s8: Saved project installed
  [*] --> s0
  [*] --> s1
  s0 --> s2: the project has no unsaved changes
  s1 --> s3: ask what to do with unsaved work
  s3 --> s4: you cancel the project action
  s3 --> s2: you explicitly discard unsaved work
  s3 --> s5: you choose to save
  s5 --> s6: you cancel the save picker
  s5 --> s7: saving fails
  s5 --> s8: the saved project is installed
  s6 --> s4: decide whether to continue
  s7 --> s4: decide whether to continue
  s8 --> s2: decide whether to continue
